abstract: >-
  An open, versioned crosswalk between the sections of narrative CV frameworks
  (Résumé for Researchers, the Spanish CVA) and the records held by ORCID,
  OpenAlex, DataCite and the OpenAIRE Graph, with the evidence type, coverage
  and limitations of each source. Includes JSON Schemas, a dependency-free
  JavaScript engine and web tool, and the narrativecv R package.
